<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">A case was created because your customer has raised an issue in the Customer Excellence Survey.</font></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Case Number:</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Case.CaseNumber}</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Contact Name:</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Case.00No000000DVoQ2}</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Account:</b>{!Case.00No000000DVoPz}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;">Reason:</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Case.Subject}</span></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Steps to be taken:</b></font></div><p class="MsoListParagraph" style="text-indent: -0.25in; margin-left: 0.5in;"><span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>1.<span style='line-height: normal; font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 7pt; font-stretch: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><u><span style='color: rgb(0, 112, 192); font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif;'><a href="{!Case.Link}">Click Here</a></span></u></b><span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>to open the case and view responses from your customer.&nbsp; Please note that cases can be created for more than one reason.&nbsp; Review the CEP responses section of the case for a summary of the key indicator scores (Delight, Velocity, Account Management, Partnership, Technical Expertise or </span><font face="Intel Clear, sans-serif">Operations Support</font><span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -0.25in; font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>).&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoListParagraph" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -0.25in; font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 0.5in;"><span style='font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif;'>2.<span style='line-height: normal; font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 7pt; font-stretch: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style='font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif;'>Make customer contact within&nbsp;<b>3 business days</b>&nbsp;to gather more information.&nbsp; Update case status appropriately and add notes from discussion.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoListParagraph" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -0.25in; font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 0.5in;"><span style='font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif;'>3.<span style='line-height: normal; font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 7pt; font-stretch: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style='font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>Within <strong>10 business days,</strong> </span><span style='text-indent: -0.25in; font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;'>document your Action Plan in the internal comments. Please note that all low key indicator scores should be addressed in the Action Plan.&nbsp; Be sure to include the following:</span></p><p class="MsoListParagraph" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -0.25in; font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 1in;"><span style='font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif;'>a.<span style='line-height: normal; font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 7pt; font-stretch: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style='font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif;'>Restatement of Customer Issue<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoListParagraph" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -0.25in; font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 1in;"><span style='font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif;'>b.<span style='line-height: normal; font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 7pt; font-stretch: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style='font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif;'>Document Measurable Action Plan<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoListParagraph" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-indent: -0.25in; font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 1in;"><span style='font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif;'>c.<span style='line-height: normal; font-family: "Times New Roman"; font-size: 7pt; font-stretch: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal;'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style='font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif;'>Expected Delivery Date&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style='font-family: "Intel Clear", sans-serif;'><strong><u><font color="#0070c0"><a href=" http://salescrm.intel.com/account-and-contact-management/customer-excellence-program/">Click Here</a> </font></u></strong>for additional training on how to process your case.&nbsp;</span></p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 7.5pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 7.5pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">This message contains Intel Confidential information and should be handled in accordance with your Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) with Intel. Access to this e-mail by anyone other than the intended recipient is unauthorized. If you are not the intended recipient (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not use, copy, distribute, or deliver this message or any part of its contents or take any action in reliance on it, and in such case, you should destroy this message.&nbsp;<br><br>Copyright ©Intel Corporation. All rights reserved. Intel Corporation, 2200 Mission College Blvd., M/S RNB4-145, Santa Clara, CA 95054-1549 USA&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 7.5pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="http://www.intel.com/">www.intel.com</a></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 7.5pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;(408) 765-8080</span></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>